      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? diabetes?? thats kinda scary lol. i dont think i could go to the doctor right now i'm super busy with work and its a lot of money. i've just been feeling a bit run down lately, maybe it's just heat exhaustion or something? i'm pretty sure i just need to drink some Gatorade and rest for a day or two. do u think it's possible it's just dehydration?",
